{"type":"item.completed","item":{"id":"item_124","type":"agent_message","text":"Playtesting suggests the proposed tracker speed leaves a narrow escape margin when two rescuers share one bomb. I’m lowering beetle speeds slightly while preserving the three behavior tiers, timed escalation, shared lives, and bomb rules, then retesting with normal resources. I also found and fixed an online pause bug: a clicked route could keep moving the paused player.\n"}}
